 glib-networking
Description: Outlook Express-shaped feed reader for LCOS
 Dispatch is a gtkmm-3 RSS/Atom reader whose chrome is Outlook Express:
 feeds on the left, headlines over the body, optional article window.
 Mail is a later mode of this window.
